---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 知識花園
permalink: /topics/
description: 依概念與閱讀路線瀏覽 FW Blog 的容器技術、AI Agent 工程與社群平台 API 知識花園。
---

<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">知識花園</h1>
<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8">從核心概念開始，沿著閱讀路線走進完整文章；筆記會隨理解持續更新。</p>

<div class="space-y-6">
{% for topic in topics %}
  {% set topicPosts = collections.posts | filterByUrls(topic.postUrls) %}
  <article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">
      <a href="/topics/{{ topic.slug }}/" class="text-gray-900 hover:text-blue-600 transition">{{ topic.title }}</a>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">{{ topic.description }}</p>
    {% set topicNotes = collections.notes | filterByUrls(topic.noteUrls or []) %}
    <a href="/topics/{{ topic.slug }}/" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 transition">
      查看 {{ topicNotes.length }} 個概念、{{ topicPosts.length }} 篇文章<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span>
    </a>
  </article>
{% endfor %}
</div>
